## 6. Salary expectations — default phrasing

When a form asks for a **single number**, give the **midpoint of the posted range** (round to nearest $5K). When it asks for a **range**, mirror the JD's posted band. If no range is posted, default:

> "I'm targeting **base ${{SALARY_MIN}}–${{SALARY_MAX}}** + standard equity/RSUs + relocation, depending on the full comp package and role scope. I'm flexible within this band for the right team."

**RULE: Never anchor below your minimum (${{SALARY_FLOOR}}).** If the form forces a single number and you don't know the band, use **${{SALARY_DEFAULT_SINGLE}}**.

