## 7. EEO / Demographic questions

These are voluntary self-identification questions (gender, race, veteran status, disability). They are **decoupled from the hiring decision** and stored separately for federal reporting.

| Question | Answer |
|---|---|
| Gender | {{GENDER}} |
| Race / Ethnicity | {{RACE}} |
| Veteran status | {{VETERAN_STATUS}} |
| Disability status | {{DISABILITY_STATUS}} |
| Hispanic / Latino | {{HISPANIC_LATINO}} |

(Or "Decline to self-identify" — both are allowed, neither affects the application.)

