## 8. Cover letter — when to attach the PDF

**Always attach** when the form has a Cover Letter upload field, even if marked optional. Use the PDF generated by `scripts/render-cover-letter.mjs` from each report's Section G `cover_letter` block. Falls back to pasting the text if only a textarea is offered.

**Default file name:** `cover-letter-{{PREFERRED_NAME_SLUG}}-{{LAST_NAME_SLUG}}-{company}-{role-slug}-{{DATE}}.pdf`

