## 11. Education entries (multi-education forms)

When the form has **"+ Add another"** for education, fill in this order (most-recent → earliest if asked).

| # | School | Degree | Discipline | Start month | Start year | End month | End year | GPA |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | {{SCHOOL_1}} | {{DEGREE_1}} | {{DISCIPLINE_1}} | {{START_MONTH_1}} | {{START_YEAR_1}} | {{END_MONTH_1}} | {{END_YEAR_1}} | {{GPA_1}} |
| 2 | {{SCHOOL_2}} | {{DEGREE_2}} | {{DISCIPLINE_2}} | {{START_MONTH_2}} | {{START_YEAR_2}} | {{END_MONTH_2}} | {{END_YEAR_2}} | {{GPA_2}} |

Notes:
- If you only have one education entry, leave row 2 blank or remove it.
- Greenhouse Degree dropdown options use **"Master's Degree"** / **"Bachelor's Degree"** (NOT "Master of Science" or "MS"). The auto-fill engine matches on these strings; encode them here.
- If a form asks for a single Education entry, fill row 1 only.

