## 10. Form-flow checklist (run for every application)

- [ ] Open URL → confirm role title still matches report
- [ ] Upload tailored PDF from `output/cv-{{PREFERRED_NAME_SLUG}}-{{LAST_NAME_SLUG}}-{role-slug}-{{DATE}}.pdf`
- [ ] Identity fields (Section 1)
- [ ] Work auth (Section 2)
- [ ] Cover letter — paste/attach from Section G of the report
- [ ] Why [Company] / Why this role — paste from Section G
- [ ] Salary expectation — Section G has the role-specific number
- [ ] Spotlight project (if asked) — paste from Section G
- [ ] "Additional info" — paste from Section 9 above
- [ ] How did you hear (Section 4)
- [ ] EEO (Section 7)
- [ ] Submit → update `data/applications.md` status from `Evaluated` → `Applied`
